    "zh": "隧道打通后，矿石和粮食越来越多，铁路公司决定修一个货场。一条短短的支线从主线上岔出去，尽头就是货场。山地依旧只许铁路通过。",
    "en": "Once the tunnel is through, ore and grain pile up, and the railway company decides to build a freight yard. A short spur branches off the main line, with the yard at its end. Mountain cells are still for railway track only."
